WEBVTT

00:01.540 --> 00:02.877
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.901 --> 00:04.236
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.260 --> 00:07.476
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.500 --> 00:13.060
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.060 --> 01:31.020
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.180 --> 01:34.420
=Episode 32=

01:35.220 --> 01:37.220
(Cangwu Library)

01:42.345 --> 01:43.321
Let's bid farewell here.

01:43.345 --> 01:44.345
We'll leave by ourselves.

01:44.595 --> 01:45.720
Are you really leaving?

01:45.970 --> 01:46.660
Of course.

01:46.945 --> 01:48.305
Or should we stay here for dinner?

01:48.545 --> 01:50.795
Xuanyuan Dapan collected
many rare treasures

01:50.819 --> 01:51.859
and books on martial arts.

01:52.895 --> 01:54.300
I don't want to soil my hands

01:54.520 --> 01:55.520
with his stuff.

01:59.045 --> 02:00.045
Is this endless?

02:00.420 --> 02:01.397
Lord ordered

02:01.421 --> 02:02.676
that if Your Highness didn't enter

02:02.700 --> 02:03.955
the mansion of Xuanyuan Dapan,
Guniujiang,

02:03.979 --> 02:05.459
this silk bag should be given to you.

02:05.670 --> 02:06.819
What if I did?

02:07.045 --> 02:09.020
I don't know about that.

02:19.720 --> 02:21.435
If Your Highness doesn't fail Mount Hui,

02:21.459 --> 02:22.920
Mount Hui won't fail Your Highness.

02:24.070 --> 02:25.970
My father and I are of one mind.

02:34.845 --> 02:37.371
Your father wants to share
his knowledge of martial arts

02:37.395 --> 02:38.395
with me.

02:39.495 --> 02:40.845
You deserve it.

02:43.920 --> 02:44.920
I don't want it.

02:45.720 --> 02:46.720
Well...

02:46.845 --> 02:47.845
Your Highness.

02:48.570 --> 02:49.517
Xuanyuan Jingcheng entered

02:49.541 --> 02:50.781
the Realm of Immortal-on-Earth.

02:51.020 --> 02:52.046
His book

02:52.070 --> 02:53.245
is a treasure.

02:54.295 --> 02:55.659
I have my own way to go.

02:55.820 --> 02:57.060
Why should I learn from others?

03:02.295 --> 03:03.735
This book will be kept in Mount Hui.

03:03.770 --> 03:05.120
It's available at any time.

03:09.570 --> 03:10.330
You go first.

03:10.395 --> 03:11.395
I want to talk to her.

03:12.070 --> 03:13.070
Let's go.

03:15.870 --> 03:16.746
You leave, too.

03:16.770 --> 03:17.770
Yes.

03:32.695 --> 03:33.836
Well, well.

03:33.860 --> 03:35.896
You don't have to be so careful.

03:35.920 --> 03:37.035
Let me be frank with you.

03:37.059 --> 03:38.146
You have neither nice boobs

03:38.170 --> 03:39.036
nor a nice butt.

03:39.060 --> 03:40.620
Your face is scrunched up all day long.

03:40.745 --> 03:42.820
I have no interest in you.

03:45.370 --> 03:46.899
Hold back your feelings

03:47.245 --> 03:48.485
and just do what you should do.

03:52.345 --> 03:53.140
I'm leaving, my friend.

03:53.195 --> 03:54.195
Please stay.

04:14.320 --> 04:15.320
What's wrong?

04:15.595 --> 04:16.595
I want to ask you one thing.

04:16.619 --> 04:17.619
Go ahead.

04:20.245 --> 04:21.476
Are you here in Mount Hui

04:21.500 --> 04:23.195
for the sake of chivalry

04:23.219 --> 04:24.499
or are you up to something else?

04:28.495 --> 04:29.635
The Xuanyuan Family in Mount Hui

04:29.659 --> 04:31.620
has been in my plans,

04:32.895 --> 04:34.700
but I didn't know the character of them

04:35.270 --> 04:37.695
before I came here.

04:38.970 --> 04:40.996
I chose to help Xuanyuan Qingfeng
in the end.

04:41.020 --> 04:42.299
I think it's meant to be.

04:44.170 --> 04:45.539
So, you mean

04:45.745 --> 04:47.145
it's an act of chivalry?

04:50.470 --> 04:52.670
Be as good as you can,
regardless of where it leads you.

04:52.779 --> 04:53.940
But sometimes,

04:54.520 --> 04:57.000
you have to do good deeds first
in order to have a good future.

04:59.345 --> 05:00.580
That's vague.

05:05.140 --> 05:07.899
What did you borrow a boat for?

05:10.645 --> 05:11.762
I said

05:11.786 --> 05:12.721
I wouldn't tell anyone

05:12.745 --> 05:13.745
until the last minute.

05:22.170 --> 05:23.219
For revenge.

05:29.545 --> 05:30.595
Jiang Ni.

05:31.420 --> 05:32.979
I can't tell why,

05:34.020 --> 05:35.435
but what I saw

05:35.459 --> 05:36.619
during this trip to Mount Hui

05:37.545 --> 05:39.180
somehow scared me a little bit.

05:40.145 --> 05:41.145
What are you scared of?

05:41.245 --> 05:42.245
Xu Xiao.

05:43.270 --> 05:44.620
Don't fool me.

05:44.745 --> 05:46.755
Everyone in the world
is scared of Xu Xiao,

05:46.779 --> 05:47.779
except you.

05:48.020 --> 05:49.995
I don't believe what you said.

05:54.370 --> 05:55.930
I'm scared of the day when he gets old.

06:47.720 --> 06:48.720
My Lady.

06:49.120 --> 06:50.236
Lord ordered

06:50.260 --> 06:51.870
that if Xu Fengnian
didn't take the book,

06:52.470 --> 06:54.645
this silk bag should be given to you.

07:06.220 --> 07:08.755
If Xu Fengnian doesn't take the book,

07:08.779 --> 07:10.036
he will reach

07:10.060 --> 07:11.515
the Celestial Realm one day

07:11.539 --> 07:15.140
and he can be a trusty ally
of Mount Hui.

07:16.920 --> 07:18.940
How many silk bags
did my father prepare?

07:19.170 --> 07:20.770
I only have two.

07:26.745 --> 07:27.745
The material is fine.

07:28.695 --> 07:29.859
It must've cost him a lot.

07:30.520 --> 07:32.180
Did he use his private money?

07:32.420 --> 07:33.500
He didn't tell me.

07:46.820 --> 07:51.770
(Strategy Written in a Cottage)

08:35.170 --> 08:36.755
It's a pity about the book.

08:36.779 --> 08:38.195
I'm glad you didn't take it.

08:38.520 --> 08:39.120
Ah?

08:39.370 --> 08:40.539
Why do you say that?

08:40.920 --> 08:42.155
Martial art is not like a stew

08:42.179 --> 08:43.596
that gets better with more ingredients.

08:43.620 --> 08:45.899
You refuse to learn from others.

08:46.020 --> 08:47.521
Now your state of mind

08:47.545 --> 08:49.070
feels like Snakes in Sleeves.

08:49.795 --> 08:51.071
My state of mind?

08:51.095 --> 08:51.795
Um.

08:52.020 --> 08:53.436
I was thinking

08:53.460 --> 08:54.696
that if I took the book,

08:54.720 --> 08:56.659
she wouldn't owe me anything then.

08:56.720 --> 08:57.836
The Xuanyuan Family is something

08:57.860 --> 08:58.860
I could use later.

09:00.120 --> 09:01.635
Since you said that,

09:01.659 --> 09:03.546
it also makes sense
in terms of the state of mind.

09:03.570 --> 09:05.740
I guess I'm a martial arts prodigy.

09:30.245 --> 09:31.196
Father has...

09:31.220 --> 09:32.220
I know.

09:36.445 --> 09:38.070
He also left you a silk bag?

09:40.095 --> 09:42.945
Maybe he couldn't say it in person,

09:45.145 --> 09:46.920
so he wrote it down.

09:51.870 --> 09:52.951
There is no word on it.

10:01.095 --> 10:02.215
Well, I get it.

10:03.070 --> 10:05.111
There is nothing to say.

10:07.195 --> 10:08.716
He killed Xuanyuan Dapan

10:08.740 --> 10:10.020
as an Immortal-on-Earth

10:10.395 --> 10:12.645
and got the retainers
to assassinate Xuanyuan Jingyi.

10:12.820 --> 10:14.100
He left me messages

10:14.320 --> 10:16.080
and taught me to control
the alien officials.

10:17.120 --> 10:18.596
Mount Hui takes on a new aspect

10:18.620 --> 10:19.900
and has a new lease of life now.

10:20.320 --> 10:21.819
He planned these all by himself.

10:22.170 --> 10:23.819
But he still died.

10:25.645 --> 10:27.695
Do you still think he was a weak man?

10:28.020 --> 10:29.471
Don't you think we blamed him wrongly

10:29.495 --> 10:30.795
and misunderstood him?

10:36.920 --> 10:38.640
Where is the son
of the Lord of North Liang?

10:39.445 --> 10:40.939
What's his plan about you?

10:43.795 --> 10:45.555
It's not bad for you

10:45.579 --> 10:46.740
to be a royal consort.

10:48.045 --> 10:50.340
Your dowry will be
Mount Hui's century-old foundation.

10:50.845 --> 10:52.179
You won't be treated badly.

10:55.595 --> 10:57.059
Sorry to disappoint you, Mother.

10:58.970 --> 11:00.810
His Highness wants
nothing to do with Mount Hui

11:00.845 --> 11:02.140
and he doesn't want me, either.

11:02.320 --> 11:03.699
It's only for now.

11:03.945 --> 11:05.380
We don't know about the future.

11:06.995 --> 11:08.740
You want to sell me to him?

11:12.245 --> 11:13.620
That way we can get what we want.

11:14.620 --> 11:15.895
You want me to count on him.

11:16.370 --> 11:17.579
No one can live

11:18.295 --> 11:19.779
without asking for help.

11:21.195 --> 11:22.315
I'd like to be an exception.

11:25.245 --> 11:26.939
It doesn't matter

11:27.220 --> 11:28.500
if you can't be a royal consort.

11:30.170 --> 11:31.779
The world is turbulent now.

11:32.395 --> 11:34.779
We can use the power of North Liang
to sustain Mount Hui.

11:40.420 --> 11:41.420
Alright.

11:42.520 --> 11:43.860
I won't say anything else.

11:44.520 --> 11:45.620
You've grown up.

11:45.845 --> 11:47.325
You know what you are doing.

11:51.745 --> 11:54.020
I want to build a tomb
for my father on the Snowfield.

11:56.620 --> 11:57.620
It's up to you.

11:58.495 --> 12:00.005
You don't care about it at all?

12:04.320 --> 12:05.699
The wine he made is good.

12:07.870 --> 12:09.920
When a cup of cinnamon wine is drunk,

12:10.570 --> 12:12.699
two peach blossoms appear on the face.

12:15.345 --> 12:16.699
Father wrote it.

12:18.270 --> 12:19.370
He also said

12:21.220 --> 12:24.045
the old laurel tree's fruits

12:25.120 --> 12:27.040
fall down like rain on the mountain
every autumn.

12:27.470 --> 12:28.670
It's proud but not obsequious.

12:31.620 --> 12:34.100
That sounds like the way
he lived in the world.

12:36.395 --> 12:37.771
Now you're saying good things about him.

12:37.795 --> 12:38.820
Isn't it ironic?

12:39.270 --> 12:41.030
Did I ever say anything bad about him?

12:49.320 --> 12:51.040
Father read books for 20 years
for our sake.

12:52.245 --> 12:53.939
Finally, he became

12:54.170 --> 12:55.779
the most tolerant Immortal-on-Earth.

12:58.620 --> 12:59.620
Rest assured.

13:00.920 --> 13:03.120
Father took all his efforts
to achieve what we have now.

13:03.970 --> 13:06.770
I will do anything
to keep Mount Hui standing.

14:21.070 --> 14:23.245
(All I want is for my love
to come back.)

14:23.870 --> 14:24.870
Jingcheng.

14:27.745 --> 14:29.140
I'm not mad at you anymore.

15:06.095 --> 15:07.047
Where is your teacher?

15:07.071 --> 15:08.420
He was summoned to Mount Longhu.

15:09.220 --> 15:10.220
Something went wrong?

15:20.120 --> 15:21.356
Mount Longhu summoned me.

15:21.380 --> 15:23.046
Your Highness,
please get on the road immediately.

15:23.070 --> 15:24.470
Something happened in Mount Longhu.

15:24.620 --> 15:27.140
Those who don't know the fact
must think he is asking me to die.

15:30.145 --> 15:31.496
Since that's what Senior Zhao said,

15:31.520 --> 15:32.795
I'll get us ready to set out.

15:33.420 --> 15:37.179
Mount Longhu invites Your Highness
to come and enjoy the view!

15:45.620 --> 15:47.460
Don't care about him. Let's go.

15:48.220 --> 15:49.220
I can leave.

15:50.170 --> 15:51.299
What about Huangman'er?

15:55.395 --> 15:56.746
Mount Longhu's Arch-Taoists' Office,

15:56.770 --> 15:58.145
the number one sect in the world.

15:59.095 --> 16:00.140
Let's meet them.

16:26.995 --> 16:29.870
(Arch-Taoists' Office, Mount Longhu)

16:46.720 --> 16:48.545
What a big head!

16:51.845 --> 16:54.270
(The Best Goods)

16:55.070 --> 16:57.349
The Best Goods.

16:58.795 --> 16:59.795
Well,

17:00.120 --> 17:02.445
does Arch-Taoists' Office
become a shop now?

17:05.820 --> 17:08.320
(Arch-Taoists' Office)

17:09.470 --> 17:10.821
The Best Goods.

17:10.845 --> 17:15.295
(Arch-Taoists' Office)

17:20.745 --> 17:22.470
The Best Goods.

17:22.845 --> 17:24.670
We didn't write it.

17:24.795 --> 17:26.099
We didn't write it?

17:29.470 --> 17:30.396
Don't follow me.

17:30.420 --> 17:31.355
I'll go there alone.

17:31.379 --> 17:32.379
No!

17:33.970 --> 17:35.059
Huangman'er, be a good boy.

17:35.420 --> 17:36.421
I'll go up there
to deal with some affairs.

17:36.445 --> 17:37.445
Just wait here for me.

17:38.370 --> 17:39.321
I'll wait for you.

17:39.345 --> 17:40.345
Um.

17:42.095 --> 17:43.275
Your Highness,

17:43.299 --> 17:44.916
you should bring a maid with you.

17:44.940 --> 17:45.940
No need.

17:46.395 --> 17:47.316
We won't fight.

17:47.340 --> 17:48.619
Even if we will,

17:48.945 --> 17:50.385
you girls won't make any difference.

17:51.045 --> 17:51.877
Or...

17:51.901 --> 17:53.096
You can't go there with your identity.

17:53.120 --> 17:54.120
Um.

18:06.670 --> 18:08.275
Sometimes I just don't get it.

18:08.299 --> 18:09.995
Do I owe anything to one of you?

18:10.495 --> 18:12.321
How about I go with you?

18:12.345 --> 18:13.460
Thank you, Senior!

18:15.195 --> 18:16.795
Why don't you ask me to stay?

18:16.819 --> 18:18.500
You are too powerful to be stopped.

18:18.570 --> 18:19.716
You are almost

18:19.740 --> 18:20.697
as shameless as your father.

18:20.721 --> 18:22.481
Senior, thanks to
the influence of my family.

18:23.345 --> 18:24.476
All right, let's go.

18:24.500 --> 18:25.500
Just a minute.

18:32.920 --> 18:34.139
This is the end

18:35.520 --> 18:37.020
of your journey.

18:38.970 --> 18:41.095
After we get to Mount Longhu,
I'll leave the team

18:41.245 --> 18:43.180
and rescue Young Master Longxiang
on my own.

18:43.595 --> 18:44.771
When I get back to North Liang,

18:44.795 --> 18:46.700
I'll confess my crime
and ask for punishment.

18:51.695 --> 18:52.420
Let's go up there.

18:52.444 --> 18:53.444
Um.

19:01.245 --> 19:07.920
(Arch-Taoists' Office)

19:13.670 --> 19:14.670
Master!

19:16.845 --> 19:18.495
Zhao Xituan has arrived.

19:22.945 --> 19:24.495
Why don't you come out?

19:25.995 --> 19:27.570
I'm in the zone.

19:28.620 --> 19:31.395
Then why did you ask me to come?

19:33.970 --> 19:36.940
It's me who invited you here
to discuss important matters!

19:38.145 --> 19:39.145
Oh.

19:39.870 --> 19:41.379
Danping, you are back.

19:44.620 --> 19:46.300
Forget about
the important matters for now.

19:46.695 --> 19:48.420
What's with the plaque above the door?

19:49.420 --> 19:51.115
I just heard from Master

19:51.139 --> 19:52.619
that it was written by a little monk.

19:53.245 --> 19:54.379
A little monk?

19:54.745 --> 19:55.745
Yeah.

19:56.270 --> 19:58.539
A few days ago, a little monk
came with a girl

19:58.895 --> 20:00.470
to debate doctrines.

20:00.920 --> 20:02.870
He's from Double-Zen Temple.

20:03.645 --> 20:04.779
He is still a child

20:05.345 --> 20:06.345
and he cares about

20:07.320 --> 20:08.370
the result.

20:08.695 --> 20:10.720
He even made a bet.

20:10.995 --> 20:11.995
Um.

20:13.070 --> 20:14.395
Did he lose?

20:16.370 --> 20:17.921
He lost two games.

20:17.945 --> 20:19.695
We let the juniors debate with him.

20:19.745 --> 20:23.059
The little monk does have some wisdom.

20:23.495 --> 20:25.980
He is proficient
in calligraphy and painting.

20:26.995 --> 20:28.495
Why did he write

20:28.745 --> 20:30.320
The Best Goods?

20:32.470 --> 20:35.621
Goods is the little girl's name.

20:35.645 --> 20:36.770
Oh.

20:36.995 --> 20:37.645
Well,

20:37.770 --> 20:38.820
what about the big head?

20:39.520 --> 20:41.040
The little monk drew himself

20:41.320 --> 20:43.420
to amuse the little girl!

20:44.995 --> 20:46.139
Interesting.

20:46.845 --> 20:48.495
Why don't you erase it?

20:48.945 --> 20:50.570
Keep it

20:51.070 --> 20:52.620
so the juniors

20:52.745 --> 20:54.670
can feel ashamed.

20:55.220 --> 20:56.220
Oh.

20:56.395 --> 20:57.139
Alright.

20:57.395 --> 20:59.500
Forget about the debate.

20:59.795 --> 21:02.619
Let's get down to business now.

21:03.620 --> 21:05.395
I've stayed out of this for years.

21:05.545 --> 21:07.660
You got me here today specially.

21:07.920 --> 21:09.520
How important is it?

21:10.520 --> 21:12.035
It's not that important.

21:12.059 --> 21:12.759
Oh.

21:12.845 --> 21:16.500
Just to kill a prince and Xu Fengnian.

21:29.695 --> 21:31.971
We just left Mount Hui,
and now we are climbing Mount Longhu.

21:31.995 --> 21:33.520
It's been a busy day.

21:34.020 --> 21:35.020
Senior.

21:35.295 --> 21:36.755
It's not easy to go up Mount Longhu,

21:36.779 --> 21:37.979
and it's even harder to leave.

21:38.270 --> 21:39.870
Let me tell you
about the real situation.

21:40.195 --> 21:41.236
On the surface, there are only

21:41.260 --> 21:42.795
four Arch-Taoists in Mount Longhu.

21:42.995 --> 21:44.470
Zhao Danxia is the Master.

21:44.620 --> 21:46.209
Zhao Xiyi is the oldest by seniority.

21:46.470 --> 21:48.871
Zhao Danping is stationed in the capital
all year round.

21:48.895 --> 21:49.996
Then it's the teacher of Huangman'er,

21:50.020 --> 21:52.370
Zhao Xituan, Taoist Zhao.

21:52.795 --> 21:55.271
As far as I know, the four of them
haven't reached the Celestial Realm.

21:55.295 --> 21:56.339
But you said

21:56.520 --> 21:58.121
that the realm doesn't necessarily
represent the strength.

21:58.145 --> 21:59.145
The four of them

21:59.420 --> 22:01.195
are probably not weaker
than Xuanyuan Dapan.

22:01.420 --> 22:03.045
Why are you telling me this?

22:03.495 --> 22:04.595
Just be frank with me.

22:04.695 --> 22:06.920
Can you take down
the four of them together?

22:07.145 --> 22:08.496
Why would I fight with them?

22:08.520 --> 22:09.859
What if they try to hurt me?

22:10.170 --> 22:11.620
Why would they hurt you?

22:20.620 --> 22:23.045
For world peace.

22:23.445 --> 22:24.445
World peace?

22:24.670 --> 22:25.795
But if Xu Fengnian dies,

22:25.819 --> 22:27.460
Xu Xiao will wipe out Mount Longhu.

22:28.270 --> 22:29.379
Who can compete

22:29.620 --> 22:30.780
with the North Liang Cavalry?

22:32.995 --> 22:34.920
He doesn't have to be dead.

22:35.695 --> 22:37.420
What do you mean by that?

22:37.845 --> 22:40.145
Destroy Xu Fengnian's Dahuangting.

22:40.495 --> 22:41.180
In the future,

22:41.470 --> 22:42.660
after Xu Xiao dies,

22:43.670 --> 22:45.500
there will be internal strife
in North Liang.

22:47.245 --> 22:49.035
Xu Xiao has left the capital safely

22:49.059 --> 22:50.595
and he is heading back to North Liang.

22:50.970 --> 22:52.470
The court hasn't made any move yet,

22:52.595 --> 22:53.477
why should we

22:53.501 --> 22:54.920
get ourselves involved in this?

22:57.745 --> 22:59.245
It concerns the national destiny.

22:59.395 --> 23:01.045
How can we be so timid?

23:04.120 --> 23:05.745
Who said that?

23:06.070 --> 23:07.260
The Prime Minister,

23:07.645 --> 23:08.670
Zhang Julu.

23:08.920 --> 23:09.995
It's about

23:11.195 --> 23:13.779
the future of Liyang.

23:14.045 --> 23:15.570
Since Mount Longhu

23:15.795 --> 23:17.220
enjoyed the benefits

23:17.379 --> 23:18.895
of the court,

23:19.895 --> 23:23.245
you should serve your country.

23:27.470 --> 23:29.270
They are using us as their knife.

23:30.245 --> 23:31.500
That's why I said

23:32.045 --> 23:33.605
we only need to destroy his Dahuangting

23:33.670 --> 23:35.180
and keep him alive.

23:36.020 --> 23:37.035
We in Mount Longhu

23:37.059 --> 23:38.545
are not Zhang Julu's retainers.

23:39.895 --> 23:41.470
Xu Fengnian

23:42.145 --> 23:43.122
got his Dahuangting

23:43.146 --> 23:45.720
from Wudang.

23:46.420 --> 23:48.221
Does it ever occur to you
that if he takes over North Liang,

23:48.245 --> 23:50.660
Wudang will take advantage
of the situation and rise up?

23:51.895 --> 23:54.245
We need to nip this in the bud.

23:54.620 --> 23:57.260
We can blame it on Zhang Julu

23:57.420 --> 23:59.295
after we make it

23:59.495 --> 24:02.745
and let him bear the wrath of Xu Xiao.

24:03.620 --> 24:05.120
Xu Xiao is no fool.

24:05.420 --> 24:06.916
North Liang will surely become

24:06.940 --> 24:08.845
Mount Longhu's archenemy.

24:11.770 --> 24:13.095
Don't forget

24:13.395 --> 24:14.740
that Xu Longxiang

24:15.195 --> 24:16.396
is your disciple.

24:16.420 --> 24:17.420
Hey!

24:17.795 --> 24:18.940
Don't hurt my disciple.

24:20.095 --> 24:21.660
We won't do anything to him.

24:22.120 --> 24:23.220
Not only that,

24:23.345 --> 24:25.295
we will teach him well.

24:26.495 --> 24:29.120
Xu Xiao has only two sons.

24:29.945 --> 24:31.270
Once Xu Fengnian dies,

24:31.720 --> 24:34.900
only Xu Longxiang
will take over North Liang.

24:35.720 --> 24:36.900
If we make it,

24:37.795 --> 24:40.339
the Prime Minister
will owe Mount Longhu one

24:40.740 --> 24:43.539
and the court will praise our loyalty.

24:44.145 --> 24:45.820
Wudang will fall

24:46.370 --> 24:47.539
and the lord of North Liang

24:47.620 --> 24:50.795
will be Mount Longhu's disciple.

24:50.819 --> 24:52.371
We can kill four birds with one stone.

24:52.395 --> 24:54.236
Mount Longhu's centenary goal

24:54.260 --> 24:55.779
will be realized.

24:59.170 --> 25:00.170
Master!

25:00.645 --> 25:02.320
It's time to make a decision!

25:02.770 --> 25:04.295
I'm in the zone.

25:05.070 --> 25:07.740
You can decide.

25:08.795 --> 25:09.995
Where is Zhao Xiyi?

25:10.170 --> 25:11.770
He is also in the zone.

25:14.320 --> 25:15.320
Eh.

25:15.445 --> 25:16.779
I still think

25:17.420 --> 25:19.295
we shouldn't do that to Xu Fengnian.

25:19.420 --> 25:22.220
There is no turning back now.

25:24.120 --> 25:26.820
Did you just say
we needed to kill a prince?

25:28.070 --> 25:30.420
Just an unknown illegitimate prince.

25:30.495 --> 25:31.735
Unknown?

25:32.045 --> 25:33.075
How do you know?

25:33.099 --> 25:34.099
What's his name?

25:40.845 --> 25:42.095
Who are you?

25:42.970 --> 25:43.970
Zhao Kai.

25:45.170 --> 25:47.139
What's the surname
of the current royal family?

25:47.995 --> 25:49.139
Also Zhao.

25:49.645 --> 25:50.916
You can tell if I can give you
a bright future

25:50.940 --> 25:53.139
with that surname.

25:53.270 --> 25:54.460
Take a look over there.

25:54.920 --> 25:56.299
There is a senior here.

25:56.345 --> 25:58.626
You'll learn any martial art you want.

25:58.945 --> 26:00.539
What exactly do you want me to do?

26:01.220 --> 26:02.420
To kill Xu Fengnian.

26:02.495 --> 26:03.660
You can't kill him!

26:04.895 --> 26:06.740
No, we can't kill him!

26:07.070 --> 26:10.355
But we can destroy his Dahuangting.

26:10.379 --> 26:12.180
Xu Fengnian has many guards around him.

26:12.370 --> 26:13.157
I'm no match for them.

26:13.181 --> 26:14.701
I'm not asking you to fight with them.

26:15.495 --> 26:16.876
Just bring him here,

26:16.900 --> 26:18.670
and the senior
will take care of the rest.

26:20.820 --> 26:22.120
Why me?

26:24.045 --> 26:25.895
Xu Fengnian just got down
from Mount Hui.

26:26.995 --> 26:30.059
Tell him Xuanyuan Qingfeng
is up to something.

26:30.345 --> 26:31.745
I'm sure he'll be interested in it.

26:31.945 --> 26:32.945
After all,

26:33.120 --> 26:35.139
he knows you used to be
a retainer of Xuanyuan.

26:35.345 --> 26:37.379
Then all you need to do

26:37.920 --> 26:38.920
is to lure him here.

26:43.795 --> 26:46.070
Li Chungang is beside Xu Fengnian!

26:46.895 --> 26:48.145
The old God of Sword.

26:48.470 --> 26:51.020
I wonder if he is still
as powerful as before.

26:52.595 --> 26:54.795
It makes no sense.

26:55.145 --> 26:56.145
Well,

26:56.795 --> 26:58.075
you're going to destroy
Xu Fengnian's Dahuangting

26:58.099 --> 26:59.470
and kill Zhao Kai?

26:59.545 --> 27:02.345
Zhao Kai wants to instigate a war

27:02.670 --> 27:04.270
so that he can fish in troubled waters.

27:04.445 --> 27:05.996
This man is a troublemaker.

27:06.020 --> 27:07.145
We can't keep him!

27:08.195 --> 27:10.940
That's still a prince you want to kill.

27:11.170 --> 27:13.820
We can blame it on Xu Fengnian.

27:15.020 --> 27:17.099
It's more whimsical.

27:17.970 --> 27:18.970
Master!

27:19.145 --> 27:20.601
One careless move

27:20.625 --> 27:22.795
might topple Mount Longhu!

27:22.920 --> 27:25.720
We need to take the long view!

27:30.445 --> 27:31.670
Just be decisive.

27:31.970 --> 27:33.195
Stop worrying about it.

27:33.970 --> 27:37.020
Xu Fengnian is outside the gate now.

27:37.345 --> 27:38.700
I'll do it myself.

27:49.395 --> 27:51.099
Is this how you discuss with me?

27:51.195 --> 27:52.819
You are ready to do it!

28:08.370 --> 28:11.020
People call me
Scholar of Sacrificial Article.

28:11.445 --> 28:13.345
They only remember the brush in my hand,

28:13.670 --> 28:16.770
but they forget
that I can also wield a sword!

28:35.145 --> 28:36.195
(The Best Goods)

28:37.145 --> 28:38.970
What kind of style is this?

28:39.370 --> 28:40.745
The painting looks familiar.

28:44.320 --> 28:45.670
Please come in, Your Highness.

28:51.245 --> 28:53.121
The vibe doesn't feel right.

28:53.145 --> 28:54.545
(Arch-Taoists' Office)

28:55.020 --> 28:56.020
Senior.

28:56.395 --> 28:58.355
You're not afraid
of the four Arch-Taoists, right?

29:01.820 --> 29:03.660
Why didn't you bring Jiang Ni with you?

29:05.520 --> 29:06.960
What's the use of bringing her here?

29:07.945 --> 29:09.236
Although Cao Changqing doesn't show up,

29:09.260 --> 29:10.995
he has been protecting Jiang Ni
by her side.

29:11.470 --> 29:12.476
If you bring Jiang Ni with you,

29:12.500 --> 29:13.920
she won't stand by and do nothing

29:14.370 --> 29:15.716
if Mount Longhu tries to hurt you,

29:15.740 --> 29:17.500
and then Cao Changqing
will have to step out.

29:19.545 --> 29:20.516
You're smart.

29:20.540 --> 29:22.045
I think you know it.

29:22.670 --> 29:24.099
Actually, I'm not that smart.

29:25.345 --> 29:26.345
I don't want

29:26.520 --> 29:28.400
to get Jiang Ni involved
in this kind of matter.

29:28.445 --> 29:29.445
Xu Fengnian.

29:30.070 --> 29:31.070
What's the matter?

29:31.695 --> 29:33.845
Cao Changqing once warned Jiang Ni

29:33.920 --> 29:35.220
that maybe

29:35.495 --> 29:37.236
she would have to make a choice

29:37.260 --> 29:38.571
between you and West Chu one day.

29:38.595 --> 29:39.595
How did she choose?

29:40.095 --> 29:42.059
She's not going
to have an answer until then.

29:43.220 --> 29:43.900
Right.

29:44.195 --> 29:45.195
What about you?

29:46.495 --> 29:47.819
How would you choose

29:48.170 --> 29:48.940
between Jiang Ni and North Liang?

29:49.070 --> 29:50.189
Why should I choose?

29:50.845 --> 29:53.146
North Liang needs to protect
the country. Jiang Ni will go west.

29:53.170 --> 29:54.420
They're in conflict.

30:02.370 --> 30:03.821
The world is vague,

30:03.845 --> 30:04.871
and it's hard to tell
what's right and what's wrong.

30:04.895 --> 30:06.370
There is no choice that I must make.

30:07.245 --> 30:07.957
I won't

30:07.981 --> 30:09.461
put myself in that kind of situation.

30:09.520 --> 30:10.770
North Liang and Jiang Ni,

30:10.895 --> 30:11.895
I want both of them.

30:14.495 --> 30:15.339
Senior, let's go.

30:15.460 --> 30:17.100
Let's take a walk
in Arch-Taoists' Office.

30:22.720 --> 30:23.720
Senior?

30:26.995 --> 30:28.470
I could have had both of them.

31:15.195 --> 31:16.195
Senior?

31:17.570 --> 31:18.595
Are you okay?

31:22.370 --> 31:23.570
Many years ago,

31:24.970 --> 31:26.395
I went to Mount Longhu.

31:27.945 --> 31:28.945
I've heard of it.

31:29.245 --> 31:30.299
You came to Mount Longhu

31:30.370 --> 31:32.330
to challenge Qi Xuanzhen,
the Master at that time.

31:33.370 --> 31:35.930
Actually, I came to ask him
for the life-extension golden elixir.

31:36.620 --> 31:37.620
To save one's life?

31:38.520 --> 31:39.520
Yes.

31:40.245 --> 31:41.245
Did you make it?

32:16.870 --> 32:18.196
She died

32:18.220 --> 32:19.299
before I met Qi Xuanzhen.

32:20.395 --> 32:21.940
She must mean a lot to you.

32:23.570 --> 32:24.579
How did she die?

32:27.495 --> 32:28.995
I killed her myself.

32:32.370 --> 32:33.740
After she died,

32:35.345 --> 32:37.345
I went to see Qi Xuanzhen anyway.

32:38.295 --> 32:40.321
I forced Qi Xuanzhen
to have a match with me,

32:40.345 --> 32:42.245
as if her death was no big deal.

32:43.395 --> 32:44.956
At that time, we only debated
the martial arts of swords.

32:44.980 --> 32:46.120
We didn't fight.

32:46.645 --> 32:48.315
But my sword mind was in turmoil

32:48.339 --> 32:49.859
and I lost badly.

32:50.145 --> 32:52.470
I even fell out of the Celestial Realm.

32:53.520 --> 32:55.115
I fought with other people
after I got down the mountain

32:55.139 --> 32:56.139
and lost my arm.

32:56.995 --> 32:59.145
Now it seems like a lifetime ago.

33:01.395 --> 33:02.956
If it weren't for Qi Xuanzhen
to disturb my sword mind,

33:02.980 --> 33:04.140
how would I end up like this?

33:08.570 --> 33:09.870
Was it really Qi Xuanzhen

33:10.620 --> 33:12.095
who disturbed your sword mind?

33:15.120 --> 33:17.645
If Li Chungang wasn't born,

33:19.170 --> 33:21.059
it would be boring.

33:34.980 --> 33:37.740
If Li Chungang wasn't born,

33:38.779 --> 33:40.220
the sword way

33:40.420 --> 33:41.996
would take forever to be discovered.

33:42.020 --> 33:44.460
If Li Chungang wasn't born,

33:46.120 --> 33:47.700
the sword way

33:47.995 --> 33:49.819
would take forever to be discovered.

33:51.120 --> 33:52.919
It would be boring...

33:53.370 --> 33:55.260
If I met you at that time

33:55.820 --> 33:57.716
and knew that a man could be
such a scoundrel and have all he wanted,

33:57.740 --> 33:59.120
the result might be different.

34:01.195 --> 34:02.670
If she was important to you,

34:03.145 --> 34:04.470
why did you kill her?

34:05.345 --> 34:06.539
She tried to kill me,

34:06.945 --> 34:08.095
but she stopped.

34:10.020 --> 34:11.420
She was the daughter of my enemy.

34:11.495 --> 34:13.436
She couldn't kill me after we met.

34:13.460 --> 34:14.075
Either to kill me,

34:14.099 --> 34:15.099
or to be killed by me,

34:15.345 --> 34:16.739
she chose the latter,

34:17.145 --> 34:18.745
and she picked the perfect timing.

34:19.320 --> 34:20.440
What kind of perfect timing?

34:20.645 --> 34:23.099
My Mumaniu was broken by Wang Xianzhi.

34:23.320 --> 34:24.635
She was worried
that I would lose my confidence,

34:24.659 --> 34:26.495
so she chose to fight with me
at that time

34:27.270 --> 34:28.895
and got killed by my sword.

34:31.720 --> 34:32.720
I don't understand.

34:34.895 --> 34:36.570
At that time, she and I

34:37.120 --> 34:39.220
were both among the four grand masters.

34:41.195 --> 34:42.545
Spear God, Wang Xiu.

34:43.020 --> 34:45.259
Fujiang Armor, Ye Hongting.

34:46.520 --> 34:47.520
Feng City Lyupao?

34:49.320 --> 34:50.320
Yes.

34:50.995 --> 34:52.996
She thought she could
cheer me up in that way.

34:53.020 --> 34:54.220
Isn't it funny?

34:56.020 --> 34:57.020
Xu Fengnian.

34:57.920 --> 34:59.756
You and Jiang Ni

34:59.780 --> 35:01.380
mustn't make stupid choices like we did.

35:09.395 --> 35:10.645
How about we make a bet?

35:12.445 --> 35:14.070
Regardless of fate

35:14.520 --> 35:15.745
and God's will,

35:16.545 --> 35:17.357
I, Xu Fengnian,

35:17.381 --> 35:18.820
will always choose my own path.

35:21.720 --> 35:22.895
What's the bet?

35:26.845 --> 35:27.845
To stay alive

35:28.295 --> 35:29.575
and watch me live a bright life.

35:32.445 --> 35:33.745
You bad boy.

35:34.195 --> 35:35.340
Senior, let's go.

35:35.695 --> 35:36.895
Let me accompany you

35:37.045 --> 35:38.805
to take a tour
at Arch-Taoists' Office again.

35:54.420 --> 35:57.295
(Dragons Rising from Lake Ding)

36:14.445 --> 36:19.120
(Arch-Taoists' Office)

36:19.670 --> 36:20.770
Senior!

36:21.095 --> 36:22.245
Make an introduction!

36:24.970 --> 36:27.139
I'm Zhao Danping.
Greetings to Senior Li!

36:29.520 --> 36:32.259
Zhao Danping, Scholar of
Sacrificial Article. Taoist Zhao.

36:32.795 --> 36:33.995
What brings you back?

36:34.470 --> 36:36.070
Did you have a hard time in the capital?

36:36.520 --> 36:39.179
God of Sword, you shook the world
with one move of your sword

36:40.059 --> 36:42.099
in an unrestrained and appealing way!

36:43.970 --> 36:45.120
How do you

36:45.595 --> 36:48.420
become a guardian of North Liang now?

36:49.595 --> 36:50.770
Are you my son?

36:50.870 --> 36:51.870
Ah?

36:53.095 --> 36:54.745
Since you are not my son,

36:54.920 --> 36:56.396
why do you care

36:56.420 --> 36:57.545
what I do?

36:59.070 --> 37:01.059
You are right.

37:02.745 --> 37:04.296
Dahuangting.

37:04.320 --> 37:05.545
You got the wrong person!

37:05.670 --> 37:06.921
My last name is not Da!

37:06.945 --> 37:07.995
My last name is Xu,

37:08.220 --> 37:09.220
and I'm Xu Fengnian!

37:11.095 --> 37:12.300
The genuine spirit

37:12.595 --> 37:13.699
is rare.

37:14.380 --> 37:15.356
What a pity!

37:15.380 --> 37:16.380
Why?

37:16.545 --> 37:18.460
I'm afraid I'll never see it again!

37:18.620 --> 37:20.195
Are you going to be blind?

37:21.420 --> 37:23.579
I could save your life.

37:24.020 --> 37:26.539
I'll only destroy your Dahuangting,

37:27.120 --> 37:28.120
and then

37:28.270 --> 37:30.395
I can let you off.

37:30.645 --> 37:31.670
Senior Zhao!

37:31.995 --> 37:33.980
Is this a decision made by Mount Longhu?

37:34.095 --> 37:35.720
Master didn't issue an order.

37:36.395 --> 37:37.395
Zhao Danping.

37:37.545 --> 37:38.820
Don't be so willful.

37:39.145 --> 37:40.179
Master is in the zone.

37:40.420 --> 37:41.595
I can take charge

37:41.870 --> 37:42.636
of these trifles.

37:42.660 --> 37:44.059
I don't think so!

37:45.170 --> 37:46.170
Senior Li.

37:47.620 --> 37:48.739
This is

37:49.145 --> 37:50.945
Mount Longhu.

37:51.745 --> 37:54.445
I just figured something out at the gate

37:54.620 --> 37:56.945
and I made a bet with the boy.

37:57.395 --> 37:59.545
I want to see what his future holds.

37:59.995 --> 38:00.995
Therefore,

38:02.020 --> 38:03.120
you can't hurt him!

38:03.595 --> 38:04.820
But you don't even

38:05.270 --> 38:06.845
have a sword now.

38:07.980 --> 38:09.320
Who said that?

38:13.045 --> 38:16.720
(Arch-Taoists' Office)

38:18.070 --> 38:19.420
(Arch-Taoists' Office)

38:28.120 --> 38:29.720
If Li Chungang wasn't born,

38:29.970 --> 38:32.445
the sword way
would take forever to be discovered.

38:37.070 --> 38:38.096
Swords!

38:38.120 --> 38:39.420
Come!

38:51.770 --> 38:54.245
(Arch-Taoists' Office)

39:21.620 --> 39:23.845
(Arch-Taoists' Office)

39:33.470 --> 39:35.099
I don't think so!

39:40.920 --> 39:41.920
What's the matter?

39:49.395 --> 39:50.395
Li Chungang

39:50.445 --> 39:52.520
reentered the Realm
of Sword-Immortal-on-Earth.

39:54.445 --> 39:55.595
Sword-Immortal-on-Earth?

39:56.570 --> 39:58.155
Didn't he fall sharply?

39:58.179 --> 39:59.971
Didn't he even fall out
of the Celestial Realm?

39:59.995 --> 40:01.715
How did he become
a Sword-Immortal-on-Earth?

40:03.395 --> 40:04.670
God of Sword.

40:16.120 --> 40:18.245
There's no need
to bring Xu Fengnian here.

40:19.245 --> 40:20.245
If we fight

40:20.420 --> 40:21.955
with Li Chungang right now,

40:23.145 --> 40:24.495
whether we win or lose,

40:26.620 --> 40:28.370
we will lose one life.

40:34.420 --> 40:35.420
Senior,

40:36.595 --> 40:37.595
I understand.

40:38.895 --> 40:40.934
You have one last chance.

40:44.345 --> 40:45.345
Wudi City?

40:47.095 --> 40:49.420
Wang Xianzhi once broke
Li Chungang's sword,

40:49.495 --> 40:50.575
Mumaniu.

40:51.245 --> 40:52.245
Now,

40:52.345 --> 40:54.075
Li Chungang reentered
the Realm of Sword-Immortal-on-Earth.

40:54.099 --> 40:55.139
When he gets to Wudi City,

40:55.220 --> 40:57.220
I think he will fight
with Wang Xianzhi once again.

40:57.620 --> 40:59.460
At that time,
there'll be no other God of Sword

41:00.795 --> 41:02.300
by Xu Fengnian's side.

41:10.220 --> 41:12.095
(Arch-Taoists' Office)

41:15.320 --> 41:16.795
God of Sword,

41:17.695 --> 41:19.820
you entered
the Realm of Sword-Immortal-on-Earth.

41:20.139 --> 41:21.745
Congratulations.

41:22.520 --> 41:23.670
Mount Longhu

41:23.860 --> 41:25.739
never wanted to hurt His Highness.

41:26.695 --> 41:28.020
What happened today

41:28.320 --> 41:29.699
is a misunderstanding.

41:30.445 --> 41:31.500
Who are you?

41:31.739 --> 41:32.739
Show yourself!

41:33.995 --> 41:36.500
I'm Zhao Danxia.

41:36.545 --> 41:38.059
I'm in the zone

41:38.470 --> 41:40.070
and it's inconvenient for me
to come out.

41:41.059 --> 41:43.545
You are the new master of Mount Longhu.

41:44.745 --> 41:45.745
A misunderstanding?

41:48.170 --> 41:49.170
Senior.

41:49.320 --> 41:51.555
I was just curious

41:51.579 --> 41:53.520
which realm you were in.

41:53.820 --> 41:55.179
That was a little test.

41:55.420 --> 41:57.345
Please don't mind.

41:57.500 --> 41:59.470
Are you one of the four Arch-Taoists?

42:00.259 --> 42:01.395
Just a bubble reputation.

42:02.570 --> 42:05.220
The Arch-Taoists among this generation
are something.

42:06.219 --> 42:07.870
I'm overpraised.

42:08.539 --> 42:09.745
Then, we're leaving!

42:10.059 --> 42:11.059
Senior.

42:11.670 --> 42:13.075
(Arch-Taoists' Office)
Please go ahead.

42:13.099 --> 42:14.099
Come on!

42:14.539 --> 42:15.619
Let's go down the mountain!

42:16.539 --> 42:17.539
Senior!

42:17.970 --> 42:19.520
Take good care of my younger brother!

42:20.195 --> 42:21.345
Don't pick on him!

42:21.619 --> 42:22.620
I'm ill-tempered!

42:25.045 --> 42:27.870
(Arch-Taoists' Office)

42:30.219 --> 42:31.219
Let's go.

42:34.295 --> 42:34.970
Er…

42:35.145 --> 42:36.145
Senior!

42:36.720 --> 42:38.445
Leave the swords!

43:29.800 --> 43:32.520
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.295 --> 43:37.095
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.020 --> 43:41.940
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.020 --> 43:46.820
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.120 --> 43:51.020
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.720 --> 43:55.540
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.545 --> 44:00.300
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.320 --> 44:05.245
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.745 --> 44:08.476
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.500 --> 44:09.740
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.520 --> 44:14.380
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.195 --> 44:17.921
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:17.945 --> 44:19.380
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.870 --> 44:23.745
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.170 --> 44:25.521
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.545 --> 44:28.380
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.795 --> 44:31.276
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.300 --> 44:33.700
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:33.995 --> 44:36.021
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.045 --> 44:38.221
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.245 --> 44:42.460
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.820 --> 44:43.956
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:43.980 --> 44:47.020
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.195 --> 44:49.156
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.180 --> 44:51.900
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.460 --> 44:54.276
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.300 --> 44:56.796
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.820 --> 45:00.920
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
